Parts of this repository come from others and keep their own licenses:

- chips/*.h: Andre Weissflog's chips emulators, zlib license (the notice
  is in each file). chips/m6569.h, m6526.h and m6581.h are altered
  versions, marked as such.
- chips/c64-roms.h: images of the Commodore 64 ROMs (BASIC, KERNAL,
  character generator). They belong to their copyright holders and are
  not covered by this license.
- third_party/sokol: zlib license. third_party/nuklear: MIT or public
  domain, at your choice (see the end of nuklear.h).
- src/board_data.c: generated from bwack's C64-250407-Replica-KiCad,
  licensed under the CERN OHL v1.2.
